        "Id": "f2872ec8-5db5-46b1-8d22-b5fd6d777b09",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Cursed Workplace",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111523097000",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 752c8c5b-2a03-4d71-ab25-d507639dc679).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening , 47.\r\rOur client wished to curse his old work place. Both coworkers and patrons made him want to rage with their behavior, through constant bickering and demands. \r\rBut he does not have enough money to buy a real witch. And we don&apos;t have so much funds ourselfs, that we could decline this slight overreaction of our client. The best we can do is make these deaths seem supernatural.\r\rBest of luck, 47.",
